{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>From one of the artists behind &quot;Deponia&quot;, &quot;Leisure Suit Larry&quot; and a bunch of game you never heard of, comes a new experience:</i><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Is THIS a game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, it has everything you'd expect from a video game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">loads of buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">pixels (more than 1000!!!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">even animation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">achievements (those are important, right?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a mouse-cursor to point and even click sometimes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">state of the art 8 bit sound-design!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An axolotl</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 50 mini-\u201dgames\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">pop culture references to ALL your (aka my) favorite game franchises</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But\u2026 is this enough? What even is a game? Does this count? How much interactivity do you need? Are games art? What am I and if yes\u2026 how many? Are there maybe TOO many axolotls in this game?<br><br>Come in and find out for only 4 bucks! Only for a limited time (&lt;= lie)! Support a more or less struggling gameartist, working in the industry for 10+ years (and still not good enough for the artstation front page). Aaaanyway, thank you for your time and have fun \u201cplaying\u201d this \u201cgame\u201d...<br><br>Jo out.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3691100?t=1745589225","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/83486fbbb957f36c331669a7d30ef8249eea6b9e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745589225","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/b800facaee680ea7bd88de6398e90f4087ba57b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745589225","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/b800facaee680ea7bd88de6398e90f4087ba57b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745589225","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>From one of the artists behind &quot;Deponia&quot;, &quot;Leisure Suit Larry&quot; and a bunch of game you never heard of, comes a new experience:</i><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>Is THIS a game?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, it has everything you'd expect from a video game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">loads of buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">pixels (more than 1000!!!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">even animation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">achievements (those are important, right?)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a mouse-cursor to point and even click sometimes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">state of the art 8 bit sound-design!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An axolotl</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 50 mini-\u201dgames\u201d</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">pop culture references to ALL your (aka my) favorite game franchises</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But\u2026 is this enough? What even is a game? Does this count? How much interactivity do you need? Are games art? What am I and if yes\u2026 how many? Are there maybe TOO many axolotls in this game?<br><br>Come in and find out for only 4 bucks! Only for a limited time (&lt;= lie)! Support a more or less struggling gameartist, working in the industry for 10+ years (and still not good enough for the artstation front page). Aaaanyway, thank you for your time and have fun \u201cplaying\u201d this \u201cgame\u201d...<br><br>Jo out.</p>","developers":["Johannes Lott"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/aba47c1db0f1427b85a7e1abfe65ecbae23e4cd2/header.jpg?t=1745589225","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) Johannes Lott 2025","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"is THIS a game?","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 116 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 116 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Johannes Lott"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/d7a16fc219f9e4f970b1b75d8163e3ef7f2da924/ss_d7a16fc219f9e4f970b1b75d8163e3ef7f2da924.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745589225","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/d7a16fc219f9e4f970b1b75d8163e3ef7f2da924/ss_d7a16fc219f9e4f970b1b75d8163e3ef7f2da924.600x338.jpg?t=1745589225"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/4b06cb877642f9fa18fa1de0b682839cb075aa97/ss_4b06cb877642f9fa18fa1de0b682839cb075aa97.1920x1080.jpg?t=1745589225","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3691100/4b06cb877642f9fa18fa1de0b682839cb075aa97/ss_4b06cb877642f9fa18fa1de0b682839cb075aa97.600x338.jpg?t=1745589225"},{"id":2,"pa